{"seq":27,"slug":"mobile-analytics-crash-reporting","title":"移动端数据分析与崩溃上报","stage":"DONE","category":"mobile","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting","rating":{"composite":4.02,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 移动端数据分析与崩溃上报\n\n移动应用一旦发布到用户设备，开发团队就失去了直接观测的能力。数据分析与崩溃上报是连接\"产品假设\"与\"用户现实\"的桥梁——前者回答\"用户在做什么、为什么这么做\"，后者回答\"应用在哪里坏了、影响了谁\"。两者共同构成移动端可观测性的核心支柱。\n\n本 hub 从事件埋点设计出发，经崩溃稳定性监控、性能度量，到 SDK 集成与合规运营，覆盖移动分析与崩溃上报的完整生命周期。内容以 Firebase Crashlytics、Sentry、Apple MetricKit 等 2026 年主流工具链为锚点，但重点在原理与工程实践——工具是载体，方法论才是持久资产。\n\n与相邻 hub 的分工边界：mobile-performance 聚焦通用性能优化策略（如渲染流水线优化、内存治理手段），本 hub 则关注\"如何度量并上报性能指标\"——是观测而非优化；mobile-push-notification-engineering 处理推送通道本身的工程问题；mobile-cicd-release 覆盖构建与发布流水线，本 hub 中涉及的符号文件上传仅作为崩溃上报链路的一环讨论，不深入 CI/CD 编排。\n\n建议学习路径：先完成第一章掌握埋点与行为分析的基础范式，再进入第二章理解崩溃上报体系（这是移动稳定性的核心），第三章补充性能监控维度，最后第四章整合 SDK 集成、隐私合规与告警响应的运营实践。前置知识包括基本的 iOS/Android 开发经验以及对 HTTP 网络通信的理解。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"analytics-fundamentals","title":"数据分析基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/analytics-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"event-tracking-design","title":"事件埋点设计","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/analytics-fundamentals/event-tracking-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"user-behavior-analytics","title":"用户行为分析","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/analytics-fundamentals/user-behavior-analytics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"attribution-funnel","title":"归因与漏斗分析","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/analytics-fundamentals/attribution-funnel"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"crash-stability","title":"崩溃与稳定性","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/crash-stability","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"crash-reporting-systems","title":"崩溃上报体系","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/crash-stability/crash-reporting-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"symbolication-deobfuscation","title":"符号化与反混淆","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/crash-stability/symbolication-deobfuscation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"anr-freeze-detection","title":"ANR 与卡顿检测","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/crash-stability/anr-freeze-detection"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-monitoring","title":"性能监控","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/performance-monitoring","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"app-launch-metrics","title":"启动性能度量","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/performance-monitoring/app-launch-metrics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"network-api-monitoring","title":"网络与 API 监控","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/performance-monitoring/network-api-monitoring"},{"seq":3,"slug":"memory-battery-profiling","title":"内存与电量分析","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/performance-monitoring/memory-battery-profiling"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"platform-operations","title":"平台运营实践","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/platform-operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"analytics-sdk-integration","title":"分析 SDK 集成实践","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/platform-operations/analytics-sdk-integration"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-privacy-consent","title":"数据隐私与合规","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/platform-operations/data-privacy-consent"},{"seq":3,"slug":"alerting-incident-response","title":"告警与应急响应","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/platform-operations/alerting-incident-response"}]}]}